{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6fdfd877407d490ce091b8f6387be32edfae8d52039fbe87bf8e703b9aa9f025", "ja": "（今日は春香が主役を務めるイベントの当日だ。\n空港内の特設ステージで歌うことになっているが……）", "zh": "（今天是春香担任主角的活动举办日。原定要在机场内的特别舞台上唱歌，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b7a6b27c055ed53ce97b6cf9852484cbc7ac122a8379cd1618e0c526f4b5a31f", "ja": "そろそろリハーサルの時間なのに、\n肝心の春香が来ない……。何かあったのかな？", "zh": "马上就到彩排时间了，可关键的春香还没来……是出什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "cd860f21ebe1b9e638a9d8756229f22190000d6e7d57f8c42e0d09d40f8c724b", "ja": "わぁ、遅くなっちゃいました……！\n{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！", "zh": "哇，不小心来晚了……！\n{$P$}先生，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1003_p", "source_sha256": "37ac3f8a243f12d8474b63109869b439d8690f6d5f9d503bec93157f7ed46217", "ja": "お、噂をすれば。間に合ってよかったよ。\n準備、そんなに手間取ってたのか？", "zh": "哦，说曹操曹操到。能赶上真是太好了。\n准备花了那么长时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "c8d710a6a3a6dd370945bbce4d7781061d3f2fb3e28f06eb007d18082285b21e", "ja": "ごめんなさい！　準備もそうなんですけど、\n実は他にも理由があって……。", "zh": "对不起！准备确实花了点时间，不过其实还有其他原因……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4f60e8d9a8e9e96dd5b23a6577e8f42613dc17153de8c539c53033ad9babb5f5", "ja": "理由？", "zh": "理由？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1006_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "ee2de08bb21880ff2e78d40eeb2cd441aed352c324236261c07769f2f2d80bf1", "ja": "あ、さっきのおねえちゃんだー！", "zh": "啊，是刚才的大姐姐——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "19361ccf771c8faaf56729e0a96eccb60595835a7ab309b500018900f16f382a", "ja": "ん？　わあっ、また会ったね！\n搭乗口、ちゃんとわかったかな？", "zh": "嗯？哇啊，又遇到你了呢！\n登机口顺利找到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1008_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "7e6ac9edcb83ae5f7617cf6a3dae33cddf6fe4189f9db0c7c50b62fa3a3289dd", "ja": "うん、おかあさんとも会えたよ！　ありがとう！\nそれじゃ、いってくるねー！", "zh": "嗯，也见到妈妈了！谢谢你！\n那我出发啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "278de4a3db3adbc7f8613f200fd4a700a9b044ea5f3c3db53fd3ed3e381152b1", "ja": "うん、いってらっしゃい♪\n安全に気を付けて、楽しい旅にしてね～！", "zh": "嗯，路上小心♪\n注意安全，祝你旅途愉快哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "935a02e53877b84a601d1ac0456883059dc9ed1790a368a37479c431e4abfcfe", "ja": "……ふふっ。……あ、えっと、すみません、話の\n途中で。実はさっき、あの子を案内していたんです。", "zh": "……呵呵。……啊，那个，不好意思，话说到\n一半。其实刚才，我是在给那个孩子带路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1011_p", "source_sha256": "49013b004c06c1ad1d3a63fc82cab4748a37a9d79ccee51d0d4cd15398bd02ad", "ja": "いや、構わないよ。なるほど、\n遅れたのは、そういう理由だったんだな。", "zh": "不，没关系的。原来如此，\n你迟到是因为这个原因啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "bec4d22dfcb92d7b8326b1b8046d648774fbab8354efc9f68301b8fe5d84d770", "ja": "はい。あの子、\n迷子になっちゃってたみたいで……。", "zh": "是的。那个孩子好像迷路了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "fee60588ca9873dc7883917706f3b5dfd5544912d833308cc2262f96569325c4", "ja": "それで行先を聞いて、案内したんです。\nちゃんとお母さんと会えたみたいで、よかった……♪", "zh": "于是我问了她要去哪里，再带她过去了。\n看样子她顺利见到妈妈了，太好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0122cf9faba4d04bf8695f610a134583d53f7fd21241f285468ef139fddf24c1", "ja": "そうか、それは何よりだ。知らないところで、\n本当のCAさんみたいなことをしてたんだな。", "zh": "这样啊，那真是太好了。在陌生的地方，居然做了像真正的空乘人员一样的事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "1c56ad3d2ddd056f3063fdcd99334a0ab80230ad64a88463e1ae74b768beb068", "ja": "えへへ、そうですね。この前も、空港で\nキャンペーンのお仕事をさせてもらいましたよね？", "zh": "嘿嘿，是啊。前阵子我们还在机场做过宣传活动，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "3d36b2efa855bbbf847753964a99356a032d2e809ef27d2764d0f34bbf2ae0d2", "ja": "そのおかげで、ちょっとだけ本当の\nCAさんの気持ちがわかるようになったっていうか。", "zh": "多亏了那次工作，我好像也稍微能理解真正的空乘小姐是什么心情了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "b3ca82eacc705875e53e9ab37ce5afbb8bc2bda94daf89d033a10149727a0021", "ja": "空の旅を楽しんでもらうために、私にできることは\n何だろう……？　って思うようになったんです。", "zh": "为了让大家享受空中之旅，我能做些什么呢……？我开始这样想了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1018_p", "source_sha256": "849477a111b96004f4939f31da5e437a0a6442449e3e11615fa31afb746a24c4", "ja": "大事なことだと思うよ。春香のおかげで、\nさっきの子も楽しく旅行に向かえただろうし。", "zh": "这是很重要的想法哦。多亏了春香，\n刚才那个孩子应该也能开开心心地踏上旅程了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "8acf7b8912656dde393073b92c745c4ee8b0f6b07039ea3d8c8ab4e656b9ec49", "ja": "本当ですか？　えへへ、そうだといいなぁ。\n……あ、そうだ。{$P$}さん！", "zh": "真的吗？嘿嘿，要是那样就好了。\n……啊，对了。{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "d4fa368432ad287b49e105577ed27ef0d1019012fd89fce019ca5f138daaa4eb", "ja": "今日は、その気持ちを大事に歌おうと思います。空の\n旅のお供に私の歌を、ってわけじゃないですけど……。", "zh": "今天，我想珍惜这份心情，好好地歌唱。虽然也不是说要让我的歌陪伴这趟天空之旅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "272960fd2bdf8bdff8a6366a47c4987b229e4874f4abb4a03ad951592733940d", "ja": "旅のどこかで、ふと思い出してもらえるような……。\nそんなステージにできたら嬉しいです♪", "zh": "要是能成为一场让大家在旅途中某个时刻突然想起的……那样的演出，我会很开心的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0264_1022_p", "source_sha256": "7663d11fb41ae91b69afb97dacfac51cf86db0f5a9c5dfa03dd86ab2c4de4c32", "ja": "（そう言った春香は、とても晴れやかな表情だ。\nその歌は、旅を曇りなきものにしてくれるはずだ！）", "zh": "（说出这番话的春香，脸上洋溢着明朗的笑容。\n她的歌声一定能让这段旅程不再有阴霾！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
